    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**** DEREK DORGAN AUCTIONEER BALLINCOLLIG (021)4871777 (086)0483003 ****\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented three-bedroom bungalow is situated on a large private site, which makes this an appealing prospect for purchasers seeking space, privacy, and a peaceful country setting, whilst remaining within just C.13 KM of Kinsale Town.    \r\n              \r\nThis property is perches on C.5 acres, with most of the lands to the rear of the house, which allows for privacy and an ideal outdoor space, for many uses.        \r\n\r\nThis bungalow offers well-proportioned accommodation which comprises of a hallway, which leads to a large Kitchen/dining room, with a separate utility room. It has three bedrooms, main bathroom and a lounge\r\n\r\nBER PENDING"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway \r\n9’9” X 3’5”\r\nThis hall leadings right to the kitchen/dinning room and left to the main bathroom, bedrooms and lounge \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room\r\n15’7” X 21’4”\r\nThis room has a tiled floor and wall area around the kitchen units\r\nThe fitted kitchen is plumbed for a washing machine\r\nA door leads to the rear garden and car park area\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUtility room\r\n7’0” X 4’4”\r\nThis is plumbed for a washing machine \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHall\r\n14’9” X 3’11”\r\nThis hall has a wooden floor and leads to the bathroom, bedroom and lounge\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom\r\n10’10” X 8’4”\r\nThis room has a tiled floor and plastic/PVC waterproof wall panelling \r\nThere is a shower over the bath\r\nToilet and WHB\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\n8’9” X 8’10”\r\nFitted wooden floor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLounge\r\n15’7” X 9’11”\r\nThis room has a feature fireplace and double doors leading the to side garden/car park area\r\nIt has wooden floor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHall\r\n5’6” X 3’5”\r\nThis hall leads to the remaining two bedrooms\r\nThere is a stira type attic access point\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBed 2\r\n9’11” X 10’3”\r\nWooden Floor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\n13’10” X 9’10”\r\nWooden Floor\r\n\r\n\r\nInfo supplied Subject to contract\r\nDerek Dorgan Auctioneer & Letting Agents for themselves and for the venders or lessors of the property whose Agents they are, give notice (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) All descriptions, dimensions, reference to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of Messrs. Derek Dorgan Auctioneer & Letting Agents has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development."
      },
